      ],
      "core_meaning_cn": "把声音、符号或信息中的某一部分“凸显出来”：可形成口音、重音/重音符号，也可表示强调",
      "core_meaning_en": "to make part of speech, sound, writing, or meaning stand out: an accent, stress mark, or emphasis",
      "mental_model_cn": "共同点不是“口音”本身，而是 prominence：regional accent 是一套显著发音特征；word accent 是重音；place the accent on sth 是把重点凸显出来。",
      "mental_model_en": "The common idea is prominence: a regional accent marks pronunciation, word accent marks stress, and figurative accent marks emphasis."
    },
